    },
    {
        "text": "It... shattered?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "The old man got this from some wizard.... Said it would keep me alive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't even make it through one fight, huh. I guess it was fake.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like I'm his fake daughter, maybe...? And now, like Reunion.... As well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mmm!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh....",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Cough* *cough*.... Blaze!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "The cold's..... gone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm fine! Amiya, hurry, go check on the white rabbit!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nice win, Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "My brothers and sisters.... I let them die in vain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "We accomplished nothing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "My life.... wasn't worth anything at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "They followed you because of your ideas.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "........",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "My death.... isn't worth anyone's time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go save who you can. Hurry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whether it's stopping the raincoats, going to kill Mephisto, or sheltering the Infected who have nowhere else to go....",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go. Go do something worthwhile.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "........",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "I'll stay.;You go.",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, please tell her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$frostnovadie_intro",
        "key": "$frostnovadie_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "avg_6_10",
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "xScale": 1.1,
        "yScale": 1.1,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What a.... naive rabbit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like Talulah back then. Very similar.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "To be able to see someone like this before I die, someone so determined to realize their ideals....",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "What about the burden you bear?!;........;Didn't you promise to join Rhodes Island?",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess that's been swirling around in your head, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Villains are what villains are. I have no complaints about the ending I deserve.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have hurt you. Reunion, and I, targeted innocent Lungmenites and single-handedly led the Ursus Infected into this nightmare. Such people have no business at Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "My brothers and sisters.... Those fools must have tried to keep me alive, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought that even if I died here, those idiots would get a place where they could live in peace.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wrong and wrong. They died. To protect me, a woman who didn't have much time left to begin with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not happy. We were used and abused. Our lives thrown away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not happy.... This last moment of life, this does not belong to me. They bought this with their blood!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "This little bit of life..... I must give it to someone trustworthy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Ah... Even if we survived, where is there to go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "We had nowhere. The only thing we were ever knew was the snow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lungmen is not Ursus. We came, desperate to save our people, and the Infected, looking for a warm place, with food, and shelter....",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's not Lungmen. From the beginning, it should not have been Lungmen. The people of Lungmen are also struggling to eke out a living.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "We should have gone back to Ursus.... Our homeland.....",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Snow.... a peaceful river.... the pine forests gently swaying.... the turquoise moss....",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "This world, it's beautiful....",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "So, you think Talulah is the one who orchestrated it all.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...If I'm right... The plot is ready to unfurl.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if old man Buldrokkas'tee could stall it for a while, Talulah would have a way to deal with him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lungmen can't do anything.... And all Ursus can do is watch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you're still here, and the Infected still have a chance. Even if only a small one...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014go put an end to Talulah. Stop her madness and don't let Reunion swallow up any more Infected. Reunion doesn't need Talulah, any Talulah....",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or.....",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "I could make a selfish request. Go save her. No. Go help her. Along with our countless fellow Infected....",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "The real one.... Walking on muddy earth.... Talulah....",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "FrostNova?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go... ahead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "I think your father really loves you.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Just like you remember your birth parents dying for you.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "You remember clearly all that your father did for you.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "........",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "How could I not know? It's just, he's going to outlive me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "How much better it would have been if he had never adopted me. That way, he wouldn't have to feel all the pain I've brought him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's suffered so much....",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "It is because he has suffered so much that he cherishes you.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hehehe....",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can call you that, can't I?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor of Rhodes Island, choices just might be meaningless, in this world.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even so, even if the outcome makes no difference.... I do want to choose for myself. I made my choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "With my own hands.... To take the fruit of the seeds I have sown.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "FrostNova's fingers grope at your face ."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Your fingers... are warm?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Strange. Your face... is cold.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "My body temperature.... Is not so low anymore?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Yes. Your symptoms are gone.;........;You're warm, FrostNova",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can finally touch someone... before I die.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "FrostNova, Amiya and I want you to join Rhodes Island.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Do I really deserve that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "If you just die, here and now, you won't have a chance to right your wrongs.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...It would be rude not to give a response.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell Amiya, Dr. {@nickname}....",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "In this world, a single person is worthless.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "avg_6_10_2",
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "xScale": 1.1,
        "yScale": 1.1,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "But she's absolutely not alone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "From now on, I am at your side. Both of you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "I......  would like to join Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Thank you.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No... thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your eyes.... remind me of someone I used to know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "I met a boy who said his brother would rather go to the gallows than beg for his enemies' mercy....",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "So he was going to walk across the snowy plains, he was going to walk all of Ursus.... And he didn't come with us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought he was the most idealistic person I'd ever met.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "But now, you and Amiya changed my mind... Maybe ideals can be a kind of faith.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Rhodes Island is all about fighting for shared beliefs.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The original Reunion.... was the same.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just the same.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your eyes, and that boy's, really do look the same.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Only, you're not as determined as he was. You're so much.... So much gentler.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me go. My brothers and sisters are waiting for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "......Father...... I've been such a fool.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forgive me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
